@host = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Listar libros → 200, los 2 de la semilla
GET {{host}}/books

### 2. Detalle → 200
GET {{host}}/books/1

### 3. Libro inexistente → 404 BOOK_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/books/999

### 4. Body incompleto → 400 con details (Zod)
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": ""
}

### 5. Válido sin ISBN → 201, stock: 0
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Rayuela",
  "autor": "Julio Cortázar"
}

### 6. Con ISBN → 201
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Ficciones",
  "autor": "Jorge Luis Borges",
  "isbn": "9789875666474",
  "stock": 2
}

### 7. Mismo ISBN → 409 ISBN_DUPLICATE
POST {{host}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Ficciones (otra edición)",
  "autor": "Jorge Luis Borges",
  "isbn": "9789875666474",
  "stock": 1
}

### 8. Actualizar stock → 200, titulo intacto
PUT {{host}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 10
}

### 9. Borrar → 204
DELETE {{host}}/books/1

### 10. Borrar de nuevo → 404
DELETE {{host}}/books/1

### DESAFÍO: stock negativo → 400 INVALID_STOCK (o 400 de Zod si el schema ya tiene min(0))
PUT {{host}}/books/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": -5
}
